Bug 2074786 - Make `HTMLEditor::HandleInsertText` not delete unnecessary `<br>` immediately before `<span _moz_quote="true">`  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD

It's unnecessary for the layout, but it's necessary for the serializer.
Therefore, it's actually necessary one for plain email composer.

Original Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330087

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332620


